# What may be uploaded to Cloud Build.
#
# Without this file gcloud derives the upload set from .gitignore, which ignores
# all of /demo/ and so drops the provider notices the Change Intelligence image
# has to carry. Written out explicitly rather than negated, because a directory
# excluded by .gitignore cannot be re-included from inside it.
#
# The demo tree also holds service account keys. They are named here so that
# loosening the directory to admit 16 KB of notices cannot sweep a credential
# into a build context.
.git
.github
.venv
.secrets
.fleet
.cursor
.claude
.codex
.gemini
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/node_modules
**/.next

# Credentials and pinned checkouts. Everything under demo/ except the notices.
demo/*.json
demo/*.pem
demo/storygen
demo/storygen
demo/adversarial
demo/setup-ledger.ndjson

artifacts
submission
sandbox-workspaces
tmp-patchapi
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
